 Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ef16e437-7fc0-5820-9ae9-b1f25d063281\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 9 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ef16e437-7fc0-5820-9ae9-b1f25d063281\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"ef16e437-7fc0-5820-9ae9-b1f25d063281\" :question/answer-fields \"553ff056-bb9d-596c-ba3c-66c55b408913\"] [:db/ensure \"ef16e437-7fc0-5820-9ae9-b1f25d063281\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/questions \"ef16e437-7fc0-5820-9ae9-b1f25d063281\"] [:db/add \"4eb4ea72-34d2-5f3b-9c3b-c3d27341f193\" :answer/id #uuid \"4eb4ea72-34d2-5f3b-9c3b-c3d27341f193\"] [:db/add \"4eb4ea72-34d2-5f3b-9c3b-c3d27341f193\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4eb4ea72-34d2-5f3b-9c3b-c3d27341f193\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"4eb4ea72-34d2-5f3b-9c3b-c3d27341f193\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"75839238-b886-512f-8b47-7b2ddbba20d4\" :answer/id #uuid \"75839238-b886-512f-8b47-7b2ddbba20d4\"] [:db/add \"75839238-b886-512f-8b47-7b2ddbba20d4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"75839238-b886-512f-8b47-7b2ddbba20d4\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"75839238-b886-512f-8b47-7b2ddbba20d4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e4cb6f06-8ae1-5829-8a8d-d39e37ea10b3\" :answe