  "before_edn": "{:db/id 17592186064218 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id 17592186064090 :question/id #uuid \"48ec6930-88b7-5aad-9bb7-c5e23e766f80\" :question/math-academy-id \"e-470\" :question/problem \"Calculate the integral $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\dfrac{9}{4\\\\sqrt{1-9x^2}} \\\\, \\\\textrm{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^2}}\\\\textrm{d}u = \\\\arcsin(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of $u^2$ as the variable, we have $9x^2 = (3x)^2.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=3x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\dfrac{\\\\textrm{d}u}{\\\\textrm{d}x}=3\\\\quad\\\\Longrightarrow\\\\quad \\\\dfrac 1 3 \\\\,\\\\textrm d u=\\\\textrm d x.\\n$$\\n\\nWe can now write the integral in terms of $u,$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{9}{4\\\\sqrt{1-9{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{9}{4}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(3x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{9}{4}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{9}{12}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\cdot \\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡3x+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid \"de1e3f3a-5a64-573f-8fb1-9952fa36a839\" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id 17592186050628 :topic/difficulty 0.8280730284227736 :topic/id #uuid \"5a0d0fb8-c0a3-55dc-a497-9f0d5f0eda76\" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id 17592186064203} {:db/id 17592186064204} {:db/id 17592186064205}] :topic/math-academy-id 334 :topic/next [{:db/id 17592186048557} {:db/id 17592186050101}] :topic/title \"Integrating Algebraic Functions Using Substitution\"} {:db/id 17592186050675 :topic/difficulty 0.9247314504586539 :topic/encompasses [{:db/id 17592186428831 :encompassing/rationale \"Initial Codex estimate from captured target-band crossing frequency. Selected account foundations: 1 rises / 2 eligible passed source activities = 0.500000; nearest selected fraction = 1/2. Crossing activity numbers [2]; waits [2]. Separate account estimates: foundations=1/2 (1/2). Selection: most observations, then lower weight, then account name; no averaging. Single-activity estimates included. Intervening target updates: True. Crossing frequency is the chosen practical estimate of encompassing coverage; a multi-band rise counts once. This does not interpret color steps as physical repetition units. Method: encompassing-report.md. Evidence: reference/mathacademy/encompassing-analysis-2026-10-11/frequency-fractions/foundations-frequency-estimates.json, pair 303->1109. All account evidence retained in the prepared import's selected-relationships.json.\" :encompassing/topic {:db/id 17592186048813} :encompassing/weight 0.5}] :topic/id #uuid \"5e05a47e-5905-5eee-b6ea-48c720a8d288\" :topic/knowledge-points [{:db/id 17592186064365} {:db/id 17592186064366} {:db/id 17592186064367} {:db/id 17592186064368}] :topic/math-academy-id 303 :topic/next [{:db/id 17592186048707} {:db/id 17592186049314} {:db/id 17592186049402}] :topic/title \"Differentiating Inverse Trigonometric Functions\"}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id 17592186676703 :question-generator/id #uuid \"c4d5e238-9192-5907-87e3-f859a830adac\" :question-generator/script \"generators/89/89ba6288402341fbddd48d7f50e3e281bba94a69c85055b6aa0d68f2023c0172/generator.py\"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id 17592186064647 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"2b3b7a90-7d72-5a99-9f10-108f806b6da5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186288315} {:answer/id #uuid \"34a56bfb-a273-5eec-9f09-a222905d86f2\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)+C\" :db/id 17592186288382} {:answer/id #uuid \"43404de6-f6f9-59a5-acf1-14d8593d6a56\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(4x)}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186288490} {:answer/id #uuid \"711eb3a2-2c35-5a61-b85b-17fa689080bd\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(2x)}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186288822} {:answer/id #uuid \"c5155d79-8ade-51eb-8d3c-822c02c6beaf\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186289336}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"2b3b7a90-7d72-5a99-9f10-108f806b6da5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186288315} :answer-field/id #uuid \"91651d73-69de-589e-aa19-a3ea361f9513\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186290056}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"acd4f39a-fd64-5311-a828-2932bce0f1a8\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-2505\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $4{x}^{2}=(2x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=2x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=2\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-4{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(2x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)}{2}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186064875 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"19438f52-8874-56fd-bb9f-7857344ac362\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(7x)+C\" :db/id 17592186330164} {:answer/id #uuid \"27da08fc-35f0-56f1-acff-a755484fdd6c\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186330305} {:answer/id #uuid \"9871b94a-089f-5bbe-8ded-48924d04a46a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7}\\\\right)}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186331310} {:answer/id #uuid \"ab93e473-1608-50b7-b492-43d6a6d77578\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186331471} {:answer/id #uuid \"ecbe9328-2d86-5c1a-b284-26c4a4a4a355\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7}\\\\right)}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186332026}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"ab93e473-1608-50b7-b492-43d6a6d77578\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186331471} :answer-field/id #uuid \"46fef57b-341f-5a8d-b8ea-18d737471bce\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186332317}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"20c23af2-eaef-5502-8cf2-7e2560ab8597\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-49547\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{49-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{49-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =3\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{49\\\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/49)}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{3}{7}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/49}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{3}{7}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/7)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7}\\\\right)}^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\frac{x}{7}.$ Differentiating, we get \\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{7}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=7\\\\,\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{49-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{3}{7}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/7)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{3}{7}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\cdot (7\\\\,\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =3\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\\\\\  & =3\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =3\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7}\\\\right)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250158 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"19b38da3-5f2b-5083-b082-6baa6d33f014\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186247658} {:answer/id #uuid \"812bcd0b-19c0-5f1f-bc5e-f010128ff079\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248565} {:answer/id #uuid \"990243d0-e530-5c29-873f-06195a661663\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"5\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248789} {:answer/id #uuid \"9987c0f9-6105-5ebc-a015-774c178a4474\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{5}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186248793} {:answer/id #uuid \"a00a5ad1-e697-5458-b48b-1b1317dfeb95\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(x)}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186248850}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"812bcd0b-19c0-5f1f-bc5e-f010128ff079\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248565} :answer-field/id #uuid \"b9cd7cdb-bf34-5d1b-afd1-7a3df6dc3414\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186249992}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"b2f614f9-7ab2-5976-a519-b4171e38a53c\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-114022\" :question/problem \"Calculate $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{5}{\\\\sqrt{1-25{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $25{x}^{2}=(5x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=5x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=5\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{5}{\\\\sqrt{1-25{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =5\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(5x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =5\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =5\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250159 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"0ae94c5a-4c0e-5d18-8e16-ca2223f1d464\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247517} {:answer/id #uuid \"8779f6eb-94c4-53a0-ab68-b0042bb9935b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"6\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248636} {:answer/id #uuid \"8f996840-de58-519e-9ad5-b2271f08b943\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{36}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248702} {:answer/id #uuid \"a7a73405-8896-5d3b-959c-d98a3a0bf6d6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"36\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248915} {:answer/id #uuid \"dd1ebfa7-4b17-5af2-bcf2-93117f7bdcce\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249385}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"8f996840-de58-519e-9ad5-b2271f08b943\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{36}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248702} :answer-field/id #uuid \"d1111c22-992f-5424-8973-a294870d0e57\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186250033}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"49cf1e17-5602-5d73-b695-bcf78c6bba28\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-114023\" :question/problem \"Calculate $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{6\\\\sqrt{1-36{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $36{x}^{2}=(6x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=6x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=6\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{6\\\\sqrt{1-36{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(6x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{36}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{36}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{36}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(6x)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250160 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"02cd4706-704b-5191-9295-cd464731fc6a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247445} {:answer/id #uuid \"3a38ccf5-fcac-5430-8dfa-c7d60a37aa2f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{2}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247939} {:answer/id #uuid \"4c9e9d8f-89aa-55a3-97cf-08796f3a38a7\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248109} {:answer/id #uuid \"8f55739b-0baf-52ac-867b-fcfbf2995448\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{2}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248699} {:answer/id #uuid \"bff3e8f2-1813-5dfd-b250-2a81a2e1016b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{2}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249130}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"bff3e8f2-1813-5dfd-b250-2a81a2e1016b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{2}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249130} :answer-field/id #uuid \"66b8014f-e254-5931-890e-409b4231ae26\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186249851}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"0f4bd8aa-6ac8-5557-b597-a73e9dcdaedc\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-114024\" :question/problem \"Calculate $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1-2{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $2{x}^{2}=(\\\\sqrt{2}x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\sqrt{2}x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1-2{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =4\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\sqrt{2}x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =4\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{4\\\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =2\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{2}x)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250161 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"0c68f15c-76dd-5da9-8a8c-db134c0b26d5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{81}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247534} {:answer/id #uuid \"2bcc6f85-a1b7-5000-88aa-4cd90bd376e5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247814} {:answer/id #uuid \"2d69f939-15a8-562a-9b01-f0a5d555430a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247827} {:answer/id #uuid \"5ba3d36c-1859-5507-bd58-e1969bafd63a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"81\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248255} {:answer/id #uuid \"cc5523a4-ec9b-5826-a4db-f3b2655b50e4\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"9\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249241}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"0c68f15c-76dd-5da9-8a8c-db134c0b26d5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{81}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247534} :answer-field/id #uuid \"b9607361-a0d1-5e53-8ce0-f961a918ae9e\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186249991}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"8d5a14b8-efd2-53f8-9736-e9a0e599835e\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-114025\" :question/problem \"Calculate $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{9\\\\sqrt{1-81{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $81{x}^{2}=(9x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=9x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=9\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{9\\\\sqrt{1-81{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(9x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{81}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{81}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{81}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250163 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"73c527d9-5fef-527b-944d-6452bf1f22ff\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248439} {:answer/id #uuid \"b49d7d3e-613f-5c56-842d-c0c3e5de4bcb\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{8}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249040} {:answer/id #uuid \"bde79f17-dd2a-5f64-a9ae-c0fae23b5c8f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249113} {:answer/id #uuid \"dc9408cf-bf7c-5267-9022-0123e7766afe\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249376} {:answer/id #uuid \"ec0cf6c1-d063-5749-83ca-58271291edbe\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{8}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249497}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"73c527d9-5fef-527b-944d-6452bf1f22ff\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248439} :answer-field/id #uuid \"aaa559e6-16f4-5c76-808e-c0ea0a5329cb\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186249974}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"836b44bd-5d8f-5551-957e-758fcb5e8836\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-114027\" :question/problem \"Calculate $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{1-3{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $3{x}^{2}=(\\\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\sqrt{3}x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{1-3{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\int \\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =8\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{8\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{8\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250164 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"3f7287b7-7d12-512f-b0ba-3325188e895f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247985} {:answer/id #uuid \"498d825c-975f-5430-af03-04b1956050fe\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{5}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186248077} {:answer/id #uuid \"6a2e0115-c9e2-5f60-b380-4494df13f6d1\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{25}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{5}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186248371} {:answer/id #uuid \"ac03fede-42cb-57af-9f79-80211eeaf7bc\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"25\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(5x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248958} {:answer/id #uuid \"b2e81403-1fcf-56ef-a15e-d472389956d6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{5}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186249026}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"b2e81403-1fcf-56ef-a15e-d472389956d6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{5}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186249026} :answer-field/id #uuid \"f87d1651-2170-52b4-b32a-7d6f3076ecc2\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186250110}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"e7c70ecc-510e-5481-bfab-ec3f7c63aab2\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-114030\" :question/problem \"Calculate $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{25-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{25-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =2\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{25\\\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/25)}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/25}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/5)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{5}\\\\right)}^{2}.$ \\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\frac{x}{5}.$ Differentiating, we get  \\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=5\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{25-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/5)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\cdot (5\\\\,\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =2\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\\\\\  & =2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{5}\\\\right)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250165 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"2488cb64-1bbf-52da-a312-e3caf405d555\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247745} {:answer/id #uuid \"38930a0c-015d-5696-ba08-428df9678156\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247929} {:answer/id #uuid \"3fe37be6-22eb-55e9-ba87-4d2f7527adbf\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247991} {:answer/id #uuid \"725143bf-9ac9-517a-9c80-3ca905fe3cce\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{x})+C\" :db/id 17592186248422} {:answer/id #uuid \"e6673b34-1ab8-57dc-8fcd-d06a4fb12faa\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249454}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"38930a0c-015d-5696-ba08-428df9678156\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247929} :answer-field/id #uuid \"87006c2a-5518-5f50-8546-d7d44af9d5e0\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186249905}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"4b8555c3-b26d-54b8-b47b-601c910c10ab\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-114032\" :question/problem \"Calculate $$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1-3{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x.\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $3{x}^{2}=(\\\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\sqrt{3}x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1-3{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =3\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\sqrt{3}x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =3\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{3\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186290586 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"1a8e08bb-1b37-5cf6-86db-c3ef539c1d7c\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\operatorname{arccos}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186288202} {:answer/id #uuid \"45dc7c37-051d-511b-9e8a-aec010663441\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186288507} {:answer/id #uuid \"58113f3e-82c1-5ec1-9b67-5669fee9fd01\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arccos}⁡({x}^{2})+C\" :db/id 17592186288647} {:answer/id #uuid \"978f50c6-52a3-5c94-9441-ace404075a2b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"9\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡({x}^{2})+C\" :db/id 17592186289048} {:answer/id #uuid \"99ed0e47-4a7c-5b89-9c0b-8ff18f3172b5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"9\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{{x}^{2}}{9}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186289060}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"45dc7c37-051d-511b-9e8a-aec010663441\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186288507} :answer-field/id #uuid \"f07d43ea-d249-5835-9f11-f5ac2c8850b3\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186290229}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"2b7a5d31-b8c0-5e03-b3eb-62f1624001b3\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-2503\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}}\\\\text{d}x=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9\\\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/9)}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/9}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/3)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\n \\n\\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3}\\\\right)}^{2}.$  \\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}.$ Differentiating, we get \\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=3\\\\,\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/3)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\cdot (3\\\\,\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3}\\\\right)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186290599 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"107a9f41-2502-55f7-8a6a-ad9668d4d961\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(9x)}{9}+C\" :db/id 17592186288156} {:answer/id #uuid \"26fda1ba-8631-59b5-be99-a0b25adfb1b9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(3x)}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186288289} {:answer/id #uuid \"3dd4480a-eb47-5df7-8f7d-7d8a0364fcf7\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3x)}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186288453} {:answer/id #uuid \"d611d7c2-8a82-5a2a-819e-f3aaaf3c8caf\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\text{arcsec}{(9x)}^{2}}{9}+C\" :db/id 17592186289454} {:answer/id #uuid \"fe0ca68c-3ad4-59cd-a28c-b4af3a7ea2b9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3x)+C\" :db/id 17592186289710}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"3dd4480a-eb47-5df7-8f7d-7d8a0364fcf7\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3x)}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186288453} :answer-field/id #uuid \"bc6db447-0452-575d-91d0-4892a31cf97a\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186290140}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"125b10d6-12e0-5b91-bec6-9d12798feef7\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-2506\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-9{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $9{x}^{2}=(3x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=3x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=3\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-9{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(3x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(3x)}{3}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186329722 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"4e102532-1da6-505c-8449-9cc76869ce8f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"36\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186327613} {:answer/id #uuid \"7a1a0201-5d52-55b8-abe6-b78bfe3139ac\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\text{arcsec}\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186327981} {:answer/id #uuid \"c31eb764-054a-5f59-8e49-ecb141552eb5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186328639} {:answer/id #uuid \"df2c1966-1b2a-5a6d-bb6c-45c4f8885c1f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3\\\\,\\\\text{arcsin}\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186328889} {:answer/id #uuid \"e319cc83-daa7-5ab6-89e3-973218f6e0a1\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x+C\" :db/id 17592186328923}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"c31eb764-054a-5f59-8e49-ecb141552eb5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186328639} :answer-field/id #uuid \"381407f6-8896-57f4-8153-d40f382fa1ca\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186329294}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"03ce47aa-60a1-561f-9a2d-d11c8a6e24bf\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-4334\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}}\\\\text{d}x\\\\,=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{36\\\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/36)}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/36}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/6)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\n \\n\\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6}\\\\right)}^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\frac{x}{6}.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=6\\\\,\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{36-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/6)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{6}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\cdot (6\\\\,\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6}\\\\right)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186332735 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"20636742-aec8-533d-81ab-483f87790c99\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186330228} {:answer/id #uuid \"38566a19-7854-56cf-af3a-e54d537a1d3d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186330453} {:answer/id #uuid \"526ca6ab-aa62-5847-a02f-822078fec297\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)+C\" :db/id 17592186330700} {:answer/id #uuid \"574c08c3-be86-5c8a-8004-c16318247a1b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(4x)}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186330731} {:answer/id #uuid \"a94c081b-466b-5fb0-a0ba-fcb864725ee9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186331452}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"a94c081b-466b-5fb0-a0ba-fcb864725ee9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186331452} :answer-field/id #uuid \"c8b5e79f-94df-55e7-982d-e299729c78cb\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186332551}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"0234d108-fb03-514f-bf51-2014068d6893\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-49535\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $16{x}^{2}=(4x)^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=4x.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=4\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-16{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =2\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(4x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =2\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)}{2}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186342064 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"2383613a-52a1-5d64-8c26-ecd04de30f0d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)+C\" :db/id 17592186339435} {:answer/id #uuid \"4c648079-c85a-5f5e-8976-d0479a4da8f8\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(2x)+C\" :db/id 17592186339821} {:answer/id #uuid \"6b5550ab-a530-5982-a558-83f8aec51f26\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186340078} {:answer/id #uuid \"7c200317-7a2d-5a1a-9a82-89183fc7851c\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186340244} {:answer/id #uuid \"ec37b5d7-c2b9-52a3-ad41-1f64c1e8cd40\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186341210}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"ec37b5d7-c2b9-52a3-ad41-1f64c1e8cd40\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186341210} :answer-field/id #uuid \"ba24916a-286f-51a8-ad99-99bcf753abe6\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186341703}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"279b83c3-9e48-526a-b453-9a5fa23b12aa\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-73712\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{8}{3\\\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\\\text{d}x=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let's rewrite our integral as follows:   \\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{8}{3\\\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{4\\\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/4)}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/4}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/2)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)}^{2}.$ \\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}.$ Differentiating, we get \\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=2\\\\,\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\n \\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{8}{3\\\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/2)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\cdot (2\\\\,\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2}\\\\right)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186580893 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"1c31c8f6-d9d8-53c5-b2d5-4515c416102e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4}\\\\right)}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186580428} {:answer/id #uuid \"5de5a8c0-40fe-5080-8dcd-16fa4bea9378\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186580544} {:answer/id #uuid \"8c9a5de0-f659-5f3b-acd0-b7b08a36484f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arctan}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186580628} {:answer/id #uuid \"d0c414a5-ad71-5780-8d90-e3844295abee\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(4x)+C\" :db/id 17592186580715} {:answer/id #uuid \"ec6e8ea5-4e2c-5195-ac1d-c3213d882366\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"4\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186580757}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"5de5a8c0-40fe-5080-8dcd-16fa4bea9378\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186580544} :answer-field/id #uuid \"75e64c80-fb76-53ed-a478-ee475bda1a6a\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186580834}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"26a6ef81-4a35-59c2-9081-35e0aed550d5\" :question/math-academy-id \"q-49545\" :question/problem \"$$\\n\\\\displaystyle \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{16-{x}^{2}}}\\\\text{d}x=\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Let's rewrite our integral as follows: \\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{16-{x}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{16\\\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/16)}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/16}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(x/4)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\n  \\n\\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4}\\\\right)}^{2}.$\\n\\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\\\frac{x}{4}.$ Differentiating, we get\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\text{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=4\\\\,\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{16-{x}^{2}}}\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{(x/4)}^{2}}}\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\\\cdot (4\\\\,\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{\\\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{4}\\\\right)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676536 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}}{25}+C\" :db/id 17592186676552} {:answer/id #uuid \"51e6a567-15e0-5bb3-9346-244f71b4e83a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676583} {:answer/id #uuid \"73afaad6-3cc0-5ad1-b38f-24a51fbfb172\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{25}+C\" :db/id 17592186676605} {:answer/id #uuid \"a82aab25-2af8-5c79-9225-5a8532b62969\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}}{25}+C\" :db/id 17592186676638} {:answer/id #uuid \"c7e001ab-cad0-5388-aeb9-ba256ce34f46\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676660}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"1c498ea9-5b57-5d02-ba93-e5238f5e175b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}}{25}+C\" :db/id 17592186676552} :answer-field/id #uuid \"28988c58-40b0-5576-90c1-baecb434fc34\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676557}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"00c0df7b-f3f7-5aef-8a44-20715d50042d\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{1}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=5 x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=5,\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{1}{5})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{1}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 25 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(5 x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{5}(\\\\frac{1}{5})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{25}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{25}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}}{25}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676540 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"11a0a2dd-94b9-53c9-acb5-8f1bb994d149\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{7 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{20}+C\" :db/id 17592186676547} {:answer/id #uuid \"39952f53-b06e-5af0-b589-c1f02ec472cd\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{20}+C\" :db/id 17592186676567} {:answer/id #uuid \"a8655662-941b-56fe-9d9a-9ab0306c63a6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{20}+C\" :db/id 17592186676639} {:answer/id #uuid \"bbf69c40-a265-50fd-8f13-97eeaa5edcfa\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{100}+C\" :db/id 17592186676652} {:answer/id #uuid \"d9f32989-1267-56b3-88cb-4f9850104bb9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{20}+C\" :db/id 17592186676673}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"39952f53-b06e-5af0-b589-c1f02ec472cd\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{20}+C\" :db/id 17592186676567} :answer-field/id #uuid \"62aed248-e6f8-5802-92f0-41cfc63b825b\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676595}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"06700047-ad1d-5b16-8026-a95be4f4bee9\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{7}{4}}{\\\\sqrt{25 - 5 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{25 - 5 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{25(1-(\\\\frac{1}{5})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5}}{5},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\sqrt{5})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{7}{4}}{\\\\sqrt{25 - 5 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{7}{20}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{7}{20}(\\\\sqrt{5})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5}}{20}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{20}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{5} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{5} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{20}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676553 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"4f664ff5-8ad0-5fbb-a886-4102a1c3c4e3\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676582} {:answer/id #uuid \"69ae4778-cd6b-5818-b92e-5784218e6a03\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676602} {:answer/id #uuid \"7b27ebf9-81c0-5186-b894-864e87744f47\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676609} {:answer/id #uuid \"af9ea903-410b-595e-b44f-e4a2c4960f1a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{25}+C\" :db/id 17592186676645} {:answer/id #uuid \"ee1773d2-c55c-5fa1-ab0f-590df321fdcd\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676689}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"4f664ff5-8ad0-5fbb-a886-4102a1c3c4e3\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676582} :answer-field/id #uuid \"19bcada3-da05-5238-a175-fffd984e8c80\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676548}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"1df3778e-4e82-53f7-a9f2-51a498e80f46\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{25 - 10 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{25 - 10 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{25(1-(\\\\frac{2}{5})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{5},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{25 - 10 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4}{5}(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{2})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{10}}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{5}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} x}{5} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676574 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"2b389124-a26d-50e1-aa90-68db0abe6c2e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676560} {:answer/id #uuid \"6ce3c644-d7bd-5af0-90aa-621960980866\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"8 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676603} {:answer/id #uuid \"7a84aeb3-7c9d-5ea6-b305-0a4fa5dacfc8\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676608} {:answer/id #uuid \"f1395054-873c-52c8-b347-999eeb014cf8\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676694} {:answer/id #uuid \"f638c343-9c97-5913-bd31-5df078a1a1f2\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676696}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"f638c343-9c97-5913-bd31-5df078a1a1f2\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676696} :answer-field/id #uuid \"00843716-9c25-5650-80f8-f7535717f15c\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676535}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"44485569-fdd3-513f-8b31-23d9e8828d65\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 10 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=\\\\sqrt{10} x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\sqrt{10},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 10 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 8\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\sqrt{10} x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 8(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10}}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{5}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676588 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"19e58ef9-3e15-5d2e-a6a3-fc4b106cd550\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{64}+C\" :db/id 17592186676549} {:answer/id #uuid \"9f229753-a714-5933-9efc-b61a0f057af9\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{8}+C\" :db/id 17592186676632} {:answer/id #uuid \"da8b5673-be99-5c3b-962e-baea82cff5d7\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{64}+C\" :db/id 17592186676675} {:answer/id #uuid \"f017ada9-04c2-5a27-b963-04bb93956b3d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676693} {:answer/id #uuid \"fc9059d4-d6d5-5eba-9226-94220db01c44\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{64}+C\" :db/id 17592186676701}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"fc9059d4-d6d5-5eba-9226-94220db01c44\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{64}+C\" :db/id 17592186676701} :answer-field/id #uuid \"48a5b7e2-4c77-5ee6-90b5-acd3e63e113a\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676576}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"596c3e80-0a77-5c0b-9dd5-ac5db525f1a6\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{1}{8}}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 64 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=8 x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=8,\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{1}{8})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{1}{8}}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 64 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{8}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(8 x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{8}(\\\\frac{1}{8})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{64}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{64}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{64}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676591 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"29ecfb90-4954-5354-9317-133f8d1b8c18\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676559} {:answer/id #uuid \"34364745-85dd-5191-901a-8585d610c285\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\\\right)}}{35}+C\" :db/id 17592186676564} {:answer/id #uuid \"3e0f4034-307c-544b-ba8b-61bda7a8cded\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676570} {:answer/id #uuid \"57b3d13c-f606-5508-88bd-c21237120d7f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\\\right)}}{245}+C\" :db/id 17592186676585} {:answer/id #uuid \"5935e9d1-90a3-5934-943c-196a2cd9ab88\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676587}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"29ecfb90-4954-5354-9317-133f8d1b8c18\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676559} :answer-field/id #uuid \"24547e6f-5e45-537a-b8ff-884f262b7273\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676556}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"5d1a2e08-17a0-5035-83a4-af508eb0495e\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{6}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{49 - 2 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{49 - 2 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{49(1-(\\\\frac{2}{49})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{7},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{6}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{49 - 2 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{6}{35}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{6}{35}(\\\\frac{7 \\\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{2}}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{5}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{7} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676607 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"027be8e3-193d-53b2-888a-0f53f0af499c\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"8 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676537} {:answer/id #uuid \"4b120c32-839e-5ad8-81ac-81c47c5f1686\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676579} {:answer/id #uuid \"80b4e40b-f2a1-54b9-a99e-6a23a97ac69f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676613} {:answer/id #uuid \"b8655cba-e3ae-57af-9942-b587a54c366f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676651} {:answer/id #uuid \"db1d125c-7238-5167-98fc-18d1b5e1fc82\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}}{8}+C\" :db/id 17592186676676}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"80b4e40b-f2a1-54b9-a99e-6a23a97ac69f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676613} :answer-field/id #uuid \"5acc9e0f-832d-5709-8a3e-cf3f43bbc723\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676589}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"7a6c524c-066d-5d36-89e6-a2f0ce921df9\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{64(1-(\\\\frac{1}{64})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{8}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{8},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(8)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{8}{\\\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 1\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 1(8)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 8\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C \\\\\\\\  &= 8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676617 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"7c7e6666-22ee-50eb-97f6-e9342b017d03\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{3} x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186676610} {:answer/id #uuid \"90fd7807-ac81-5841-8275-8d5bd923a884\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"4 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{3} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676620} {:answer/id #uuid \"97c341f9-c5f4-5b33-a520-f32acebf91b6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186676625} {:answer/id #uuid \"da83ea42-6426-5bd3-80cb-0ca878cf408f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"4 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{3} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676674} {:answer/id #uuid \"fb2a09b8-805b-5475-a6be-01cfe4a50665\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{3} x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186676697}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"fb2a09b8-805b-5475-a6be-01cfe4a50665\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{3} x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186676697} :answer-field/id #uuid \"3635e6b1-85d6-5b93-b14d-7ce3dbc289ab\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676565}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"86099405-77c6-5190-8a2a-9987ead0ebf9\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 3 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=\\\\sqrt{3} x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\sqrt{3},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 3 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 4\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\sqrt{3} x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 4(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{3})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{3}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{3} x \\\\right)}}{3}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676624 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"4d38b5e3-3659-5a61-900d-e832f7846ae6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676581} {:answer/id #uuid \"78711e5b-6114-5c41-a3f6-b0b103bd7cbc\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{15}+C\" :db/id 17592186676606} {:answer/id #uuid \"af3e7701-d510-5090-990a-82d54288ae3e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676644} {:answer/id #uuid \"b2540c98-63e3-50df-9fd4-f4149cfcdb93\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676648} {:answer/id #uuid \"bc10dfc0-5725-5c3c-912b-175284c24be8\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676653}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"4d38b5e3-3659-5a61-900d-e832f7846ae6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676581} :answer-field/id #uuid \"679b27a5-90c8-5515-b2e2-800cae783b34\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676600}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"95936323-2406-5bb2-859c-74d73dc5a714\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{6}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{9 - 3 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - 3 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{9(1-(\\\\frac{1}{3})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{3},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\sqrt{3})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{6}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{9 - 3 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2}{5}(\\\\sqrt{3})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3}}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{5}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2 \\\\sqrt{3} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676628 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"3ace5ed8-cf7c-54d3-aa20-2677aaa12090\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676569} {:answer/id #uuid \"492e234d-5019-5bc6-a8e0-a9ba061adba1\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676577} {:answer/id #uuid \"9a3fc933-f396-51ab-81a9-5acbf7c80a86\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}}{45}+C\" :db/id 17592186676627} {:answer/id #uuid \"e3fd2345-fa67-5843-9c74-c2fd568a5f82\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}}{15}+C\" :db/id 17592186676683} {:answer/id #uuid \"e7b88f32-5eb5-55b9-b209-fa037946585a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676685}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"e7b88f32-5eb5-55b9-b209-fa037946585a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676685} :answer-field/id #uuid \"08a211b5-3488-52cf-9f07-cb54fab2995a\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676542}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"9c2f398a-4d2e-5089-b8b8-70c8313ce43a\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{8}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{9(1-(\\\\frac{1}{9})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{3}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{3},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{8}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8}{15}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{3})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8}{15}(3)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{5}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{3} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676635 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"1bf57845-5a4f-5b3e-870d-d444b93b35e5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676551} {:answer/id #uuid \"2efbd794-6227-5913-8df7-70d5c8da47e3\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676562} {:answer/id #uuid \"6e04e21b-66e6-59a9-8b1f-aba025a53a07\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676604} {:answer/id #uuid \"c1833e8d-e7d3-51e6-bff2-4cd6f40213c7\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186676655} {:answer/id #uuid \"df72e352-6d32-5afe-b916-4ad7a007f797\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{9}+C\" :db/id 17592186676678}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"2efbd794-6227-5913-8df7-70d5c8da47e3\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676562} :answer-field/id #uuid \"37ff69c9-ad83-5d1e-a355-4ef4c878b6bc\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676566}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"a57f0d65-3f7b-5093-8b5d-c66248b0abe5\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{36 - 2 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{36 - 2 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{36(1-(\\\\frac{1}{18})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{6},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(3 \\\\sqrt{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{36 - 2 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{2}{3}(3 \\\\sqrt{2})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 2 \\\\sqrt{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 2 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C \\\\\\\\  &= 2 \\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676637 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"04280869-47cd-51fb-bd56-21c6fc5838e2\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{20}+C\" :db/id 17592186676538} {:answer/id #uuid \"4a7dd127-f3c7-5b5f-b1d1-85ec960d67de\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{35}+C\" :db/id 17592186676578} {:answer/id #uuid \"62e8f05f-97cc-5d99-a0be-37e571eec26d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{35}+C\" :db/id 17592186676596} {:answer/id #uuid \"acf640ac-2120-5fb5-8cf7-f2e16ceb502a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{35}+C\" :db/id 17592186676642} {:answer/id #uuid \"e1b083a2-8377-5d49-9b34-8079d5287b83\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{10}+C\" :db/id 17592186676679}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"62e8f05f-97cc-5d99-a0be-37e571eec26d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{35}+C\" :db/id 17592186676596} :answer-field/id #uuid \"d2203131-1971-567e-9dad-1a25974fd980\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676667}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"a7ba47cf-596e-5b89-8f83-7c1f409bdcdd\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{9}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{36 - 7 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{36 - 7 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{36(1-(\\\\frac{7}{36})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7}}{6},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{6 \\\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{9}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{36 - 7 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3}{10}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3}{10}(\\\\frac{6 \\\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7}}{35}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{35}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{6} \\\\right)}}{35}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676643 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"0b6bdde3-325c-5745-872c-096f23978a80\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{8}+C\" :db/id 17592186676545} {:answer/id #uuid \"5c3f3b47-ee74-5a13-8943-f93e8c5b433f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{8}+C\" :db/id 17592186676590} {:answer/id #uuid \"5d33c97c-ce11-5e9e-837d-f5be1d9f54b6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{8}+C\" :db/id 17592186676592} {:answer/id #uuid \"65e22a0e-845f-5a48-9bb3-ca1a76f9f8f1\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"24 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676597} {:answer/id #uuid \"efcb1b34-754e-5763-8d6e-b7755fdc5e2c\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676692}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"0b6bdde3-325c-5745-872c-096f23978a80\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{8}+C\" :db/id 17592186676545} :answer-field/id #uuid \"beb52e1f-9018-57f8-9c4e-4ba4b2465e07\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676654}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"aeb4b559-27b4-5499-b515-6939cb760420\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 64 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=8 x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=8,\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{1}{8})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{3}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 64 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 3\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(8 x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 3(\\\\frac{1}{8})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{8}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}}{8}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676650 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"5e5c1395-3180-5893-89d4-0f9891c571e5\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676593} {:answer/id #uuid \"941ef9f9-6159-51e1-a7dc-d50c626d0558\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676622} {:answer/id #uuid \"aa1b0bcb-60f1-50c6-b296-5783cec35c57\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676641} {:answer/id #uuid \"c74cc787-2dd0-5b0e-96b7-74518b5f3d84\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676659} {:answer/id #uuid \"c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676662}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"c8411b89-dd93-5132-9a1f-978d794477bb\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\" :db/id 17592186676662} :answer-field/id #uuid \"d2f427b2-9233-50c5-9aee-12c21f7aa2c8\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676668}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"b827135e-0cd3-5561-ac5d-10676a4c5f9e\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{8}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{4(1-(\\\\frac{1}{4})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{2}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{2},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{8}{5}}{\\\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{2})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4}{5}(2)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{5}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{8 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{2} \\\\right)}}{5}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676656 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"6782df1e-4d03-5c54-bb1a-08d21c527b97\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676599} {:answer/id #uuid \"9975dc61-bc56-5617-a016-567a3ee1b51e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676626} {:answer/id #uuid \"a4b55f5c-24ff-5bef-83f9-11bd528fee90\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676633} {:answer/id #uuid \"fb6c7d4b-a0dd-5017-9269-39c7f5e82f17\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676698} {:answer/id #uuid \"fcc4f02a-f8e8-5417-a314-b47a273aa821\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676702}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"a4b55f5c-24ff-5bef-83f9-11bd528fee90\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676633} :answer-field/id #uuid \"6669c3de-2402-5ecc-b193-85ab401d4cad\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676598}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"c3725f6e-6465-5347-b4c3-9fbe02106733\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{9}{\\\\sqrt{9 - 7 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{9 - 7 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{9(1-(\\\\frac{7}{9})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7}}{3},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{9}{\\\\sqrt{9 - 7 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 3\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 3(\\\\frac{3 \\\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7}}{7}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{7}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7} x}{3} \\\\right)}}{7}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676657 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"1fbe9b1d-f277-5dc4-b54d-ce84ab329d1b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676555} {:answer/id #uuid \"39fb2c59-5643-5a74-9272-aca623e70e85\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676568} {:answer/id #uuid \"4061e863-62d3-504f-b147-21643eb671b3\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676572} {:answer/id #uuid \"8d912bed-0479-5a8d-92b1-ddea3ed41c6f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\\\right)}}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186676619} {:answer/id #uuid \"b002eeca-bc61-5614-b62b-8eec96416915\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676646}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"b002eeca-bc61-5614-b62b-8eec96416915\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676646} :answer-field/id #uuid \"d8e1c793-b298-5ef3-8a3d-aeb9c648f8f7\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676672}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid \"c401b599-aeb3-532e-ad3b-4af24ac3d788\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{4 - 2 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{4 - 2 x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{4(1-(\\\\frac{1}{2})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{2},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\sqrt{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{4 - 2 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{2}(\\\\sqrt{2})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2} x}{2} \\\\right)}}{2}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676664 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"045c4ed0-9a0a-5238-a1ce-5fc55821d32a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6} \\\\right)}}{3}+C\" :db/id 17592186676539} {:answer/id #uuid \"06aa1893-7344-5203-8272-5774651e1595\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676541} {:answer/id #uuid \"4062997c-00f3-54d8-86c9-2088252c6427\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6} \\\\right)}}{18}+C\" :db/id 17592186676573} {:answer/id #uuid \"a90839e2-0213-5afb-ae3e-1ddd2a32b599\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676640} {:answer/id #uuid \"e2b2290d-4132-52c9-ab25-6554b73deb8a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676681}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"e2b2290d-4132-52c9-ab25-6554b73deb8a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676681} :answer-field/id #uuid \"e75c4dd2-8d4a-5406-8e98-9ad1ab0f5124\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676684}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"cc91b79d-2e80-5826-ab2d-40a1036ba80b\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{36 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{36 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{36(1-(\\\\frac{1}{36})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{6}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{6},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(6)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{2}{\\\\sqrt{36 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{6})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{3}(6)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 2\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C \\\\\\\\  &= 2 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{6} \\\\right)}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676665 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"691332c9-dfd1-51e4-a111-41b0aa45d969\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676601} {:answer/id #uuid \"c8375ac6-3c5b-5845-a3f6-a15c693c3a45\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"18 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676661} {:answer/id #uuid \"c898bf78-400f-5e7d-ad7a-85cef23b1496\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"9 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676663} {:answer/id #uuid \"ddbbad9e-db5e-5340-afb0-43681aee390c\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676677} {:answer/id #uuid \"ea08fb37-0d0a-5712-8346-ac46ba2af427\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676687}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"691332c9-dfd1-51e4-a111-41b0aa45d969\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\" :db/id 17592186676601} :answer-field/id #uuid \"1e8caa8a-5915-593c-9748-faadedfc7bcc\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676554}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"ce5bfc5d-dffe-5991-a117-a20a71465d0f\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{9}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=2 x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=2,\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{9}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 9\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(2 x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 9(\\\\frac{1}{2})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9}{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{2}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{9 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}}{2}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676669 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"5 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676544} {:answer/id #uuid \"1b7ae7f2-7de4-5833-95c5-d5a09eaa1bf6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"5 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676550} {:answer/id #uuid \"9d812eb4-7438-5ddd-85c4-457629b790d6\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{5 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7} \\\\right)}}{49}+C\" :db/id 17592186676630} {:answer/id #uuid \"a61d12cc-5846-5c95-8c47-c6df58f663fb\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{5 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7} \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676636} {:answer/id #uuid \"d5c3fbd2-539a-534d-8878-d35f6bce05e3\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"5 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676670}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"0b39f5d1-fd11-5ed7-b733-633a76f2fe92\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"5 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676544} :answer-field/id #uuid \"2ebbfaab-4ad6-5d41-bfe4-2341309f1e5f\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676561}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"d4c8c0b5-5c65-5fbb-9a35-cbd531acd604\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{5}{\\\\sqrt{49 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{49 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{49(1-(\\\\frac{1}{49})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{7}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{7},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(7)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{5}{\\\\sqrt{49 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{5}{7}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{7})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{5}{7}(7)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 5\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 5 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C \\\\\\\\  &= 5 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{7} \\\\right)}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676671 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"337e711f-9e4d-5552-bbfa-09963d5ba03b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}}{64}+C\" :db/id 17592186676563} {:answer/id #uuid \"4cf126a6-16e3-5343-9783-4f334b632a2b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676580} {:answer/id #uuid \"52d4c1aa-63cf-53a5-a1a4-e0c5f125159c\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676584} {:answer/id #uuid \"e3945987-f174-513e-b94e-49b9786ba73e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676682} {:answer/id #uuid \"ee4959eb-87e3-53ab-818c-6eb129841585\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}}{8}+C\" :db/id 17592186676690}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"e3945987-f174-513e-b94e-49b9786ba73e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676682} :answer-field/id #uuid \"9c2f8731-677b-5e51-83ba-52ef3602f024\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676629}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"d6028e79-67ed-54bc-91ee-bc79ddc04de9\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{64(1-(\\\\frac{1}{64})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{8}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{8},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(8)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{64 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{8}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{8})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{8}(8)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 1\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{8} \\\\right)}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676686 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"08ef48eb-bfc4-5b6f-bcfa-a949fb85d64e\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186676543} {:answer/id #uuid \"836b8e2a-0a2f-57de-ab5a-09f3325f52ed\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{12}+C\" :db/id 17592186676614} {:answer/id #uuid \"9da912b7-c82a-588d-aad3-9405b645cb2b\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{108}+C\" :db/id 17592186676631} {:answer/id #uuid \"c6770fe8-a44d-5ea7-a39f-9b0d266ce530\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186676658} {:answer/id #uuid \"eeac7f1b-0800-5c25-bcb3-956419b51d97\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186676691}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"eeac7f1b-0800-5c25-bcb3-956419b51d97\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{4}+C\" :db/id 17592186676691} :answer-field/id #uuid \"b0a88d44-4f1b-597d-ab5a-a45cbcf2124a\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676647}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"e801a538-fddf-55dd-bfcb-170ff82d56d9\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{3}{4}}{\\\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{81(1-(\\\\frac{1}{81})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{9}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{9},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(9)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\frac{3}{4}}{\\\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{12}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{9})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{12}(9)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{4}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{3 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{4}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676688 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"29c4591a-0088-5834-a563-f44a66bce641\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676558} {:answer/id #uuid \"58f72fc4-f805-5a35-acfe-283e69f73462\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676586} {:answer/id #uuid \"7eb0c0f6-fead-577e-adb0-01e2bd9f8186\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{10}+C\" :db/id 17592186676611} {:answer/id #uuid \"88c6b615-b8be-51c5-a731-8dbc27f69f86\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{10}+C\" :db/id 17592186676618} {:answer/id #uuid \"a54a7a68-3cbc-5153-bdfb-83f4b687d385\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{10}+C\" :db/id 17592186676634}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"88c6b615-b8be-51c5-a731-8dbc27f69f86\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{10}+C\" :db/id 17592186676618} :answer-field/id #uuid \"b62a0ac4-4910-5d87-9766-e2bf18b756a7\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676649}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"eb6f8ce4-1f1e-518a-95af-5865fb0347a5\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 10 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=\\\\sqrt{10} x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\sqrt{10},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 10 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 1\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\sqrt{10} x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 1(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{10})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10}}{10}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{10}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{10} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{10} x \\\\right)}}{10}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676699 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"0bf6872b-7da0-5aa8-a2a3-6dfbb139754a\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{7} x \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676546} {:answer/id #uuid \"847e59e1-e3be-5d9d-8be7-63f32d39ed17\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"4 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{7} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676615} {:answer/id #uuid \"8494d033-7069-5320-8d91-c79268ff4287\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{7} x \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676616} {:answer/id #uuid \"9147250a-c384-5f07-81c6-b0b956f12fc2\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"4 \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{7} x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676621} {:answer/id #uuid \"f62cd99d-7ab8-5483-9fe6-a98f7846d960\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676695}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"8494d033-7069-5320-8d91-c79268ff4287\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{7} x \\\\right)}}{7}+C\" :db/id 17592186676616} :answer-field/id #uuid \"949ad09e-2408-5c08-ace9-816c5ab9a35d\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676623}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid \"fbd73161-c0af-5832-8d19-6107bda0ef77\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 7 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"Use the linear substitution $u=\\\\sqrt{7} x.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\sqrt{7},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{4}{\\\\sqrt{1 - 7 x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 4\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\sqrt{7} x)^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= 4(\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{7}}{7})\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{7}}{7}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}}{7}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{4 \\\\sqrt{7} \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\sqrt{7} x \\\\right)}}{7}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186676700 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"3e32e157-a2bb-5778-9bc8-d1fe7100758f\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arctan}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676571} {:answer/id #uuid \"478c075e-3783-5295-a021-8a3fa767a838\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{81}+C\" :db/id 17592186676575} {:answer/id #uuid \"617c497a-66af-5f65-8666-45f2e132805d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676594} {:answer/id #uuid \"d0d4aeaf-ef1e-5aa7-86c5-21d357f6e0bb\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676666} {:answer/id #uuid \"e1e2064c-c04d-51df-9f6c-3cfbbe08e677\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}}{9}+C\" :db/id 17592186676680}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"d0d4aeaf-ef1e-5aa7-86c5-21d357f6e0bb\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}+C\" :db/id 17592186676666} :answer-field/id #uuid \"8006da17-ecb9-5a36-aad0-18d773b11dd1\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id 17592186676612}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid \"fbda043b-7d01-51c0-ac35-cea779e23de9\" :question/problem \"Evaluate the integral. Give an exact answer.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\" :question/worked-solution \"First factor the constant in the denominator:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}=\\\\sqrt{81(1-(\\\\frac{1}{81})x^{2})}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the linear substitution $u=\\\\frac{x}{9}.$ Then\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{\\\\mathrm{d}u}{\\\\mathrm{d}x}=\\\\frac{1}{9},\\\\qquad \\\\mathrm{d}x=(9)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nApply the basic inverse-trigonometric integral:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}& \\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{81 - x^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{9}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-(\\\\frac{x}{9})^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\frac{1}{9}(9)\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= 1\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{1-u^{2}}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C \\\\\\\\  &= \\\\operatorname{arcsin}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{9} \\\\right)}+C\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"}] :knowledge-point/title \"Calculating Indefinite Integrals Using Substitution with Inverse Sine\"}",
